 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"b500ca38-9aef-4169-835c-ce1bacc18606"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
From the centre of a 3 \[Times] 3 grid eight rays leave, two through each \
neighbour, each ending at a corner.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"a6dbd782-05fb-4995-a0f0-d7da1d9c41ee"],

